```
Title: Local Groups Discovery Attempt - Linux
Author: Ömer Günal, Alejandro Ortuno, oscd.community
Date: 2020-10-11
Level: low
Description: Detects attempts to enumerate local groups and group membership via common Linux utilities and sensitive file access.
 Adversaries may read files such as /etc/group and /etc/gshadow, or use tools like getent and groups to identify
 group memberships and privilege assignments on a compromised system.
MITRE Tactic: Discovery
Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1069.001
Reference: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_local_groups.yml
 False Positives:
   - Legitimate administration activities
```
(CommandLine IN ("* group*", "* gshadow*") Image="*/getent") OR Image="*/groups" OR (CommandLine IN ("*group*", "*gshadow*") Image IN ("*/cat", "*/ed", "*/emacs", "*/head", "*/less", "*/makemap", "*/more", "*/nano", "*/sqlite3", "*/tail", "*/vi", "*/vim")) OR (CommandLine="*group*" Image="*/ypcat")